OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy, cold and wet day with
OL,6,Fpersistent rain and some strong winds.
OL,7,FSleet or snow continuing to fall
OL,8,Facross the hills until late morning
OL,9,Fwith some accumulations possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA wet and cold evening with
OL,12,Frain and some sleet over the hills,
OL,13,Fgusty winds will gradually ease though
OL,14,Fremaining blustery along the coast.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FChangeable, with periods of
OL,17,Frain and some sunny intervals during
OL,18,Fthe morning ahead of another band of
OL,19,Fcontinuous rain arrives during the
OL,20,Fafternoon. Winds light but breezy
OL,21,Falong the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
