OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDrier
OL,6,Fand brighter on Thursday after early
OL,7,Frain. Largely dry Friday and Saturday
OL,8,Fbut a chance of coastal showers.
OL,9,FTemperatures below normal.
